sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Sender
    participant B as Receiver
    Note over A,B: Normal delivery
    A->>B: CHAT (seq = n)
    B-->>A: ACK (seq = n)
    Note over A,B: Loss and retransmission
    A-xB: CHAT (seq = n+1) lost
    Note right of A: timeout 200 ms, no ACK
    A->>B: CHAT (seq = n+1) retransmit
    B-->>A: ACK (seq = n+1)
